ollowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1913,"digest":"sha256:d72ea9f0444c25dad31f562dd21bc4a1117193c64403007f3203845af0f31058","download_count":7,"created_at":"2026-09-17T17:28:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T17:29:08Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.60.5/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.60.5","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.60.5","body":"Motion Lab now uses the game’s shared reading preferences and keeps preview controls predictable when loading fails or the page is interrupted.\n\n- Text size and font changes redraw labels while preserving the selected craft and preview settings.\n- Reading and Back remain available during loading. A failed preset load offers keyboard-accessible Retry.\n- Returning to an interrupted preview requires explicit Play.\n- Animated PNG artwork uses its authored default still image for reduced-motion preview. Original uploads remain unchanged.\n- Runtime-maintainer and animation-director guides document the shared preference owner and preview contract.\n\nThis correction belongs to P05. It does not complete P03, P05, Team artwork parity or browser/device qualification. Gameplay rules, score authority and campaign artwork remain unchanged.\n\nBoth complete hosted test families passed **5,582 tests across 444 files**, with zero failures, skipped, cancelled or TODO tests. The six source gates, production reproduction/readiness, ordinary build and frozen-package inspection passed for source `a336f18306a425f6575b77a3017056d32155043f` (PR #93).\n\nThe first qualification exposed one outdated integration assertion; its failure and narrow correction remain in the retained evidence. Local native checks cover reading preferences, preview preservation, owned animated-image posters and loading failure/retry. They do not establish physical controller/touch, actual BFCache admission, a complete offline journey or every screen at zoom.\n\nPredecessor: [v0.60.4](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/tag/v0.60.4), retained unchanged in Archive19. Pages deployment and affected public-browser verification follow this frozen-source release; they are recorded separately before scoped acceptance.\n"}